{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>AI醫藥股近期跌勢較急，其中劑泰科技連跌第五日。股評人伍禮賢認為，相關股份可能受AI大模型股的跌勢拖累，雖然部份公司的盈利規模不算多，但收入增長相對可觀，短線有望博反彈。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T04:59:35.838969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T04:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:58:46.994657+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T04:57:45.931752+00:00","content_hash":"f59c43bd6cd931e13add3d94f2bca3c11f468af4ffd0788cacc6e12dd98c6dee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}